OL,3,GNEWSASwinney defends claims about Scots
OL,4,A'losing' pensions
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney has defended comments he
OL,7,Fmade about proposed changes to the UK
OL,8,Fstate pension amid claims he may have
OL,9,Fmisled parliament.
OL,11,FAfter Andy Burnham announced potential
OL,12,Freforms to the "triple lock", the first
OL,13,Fminister told MSPs that "we are now
OL,14,Fgoing to lose our pensions".
OL,16,FScottish Conservative leader Russell
OL,17,FFindlay said this was an "inaccurate
OL,18,Fand irresponsible" comment which could
OL,19,Fcause concern to pensioners.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
