OL,3,GNEWSASwinney defends claims about Scots
OL,4,A'losing' pensions
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney has now written to Findlay
OL,7,Fdefending the remarks - adding that the
OL,8,Findependent advisers who oversee the
OL,9,Fministerial code could initiate an
OL,10,Finvestigation should they wish.
